static const char* const C8B[] = { "ね invites agreement. You already think it is true and you are checking, or you are being companionable: このコーヒーはおいしいですね — \"this coffee is good, isn’t it\".", "よ goes the other way. It says: I know this and you probably do not. あのとけいもはっせんえんですよ — new information, handed over.", "Neither is compulsory and both are easy to overuse. よ on something the other person obviously knows can sound like you are correcting them." };
